WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.770
On 27 September 2020,

2
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:10.450
Azerbaijan launched an offensive
along the whole line of contact,

3
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:14.069
and war returned to Artsakh
after a quarter century.

4
00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:16.773
This war was fought from the sky.

5
00:00:16.813 --> 00:00:21.083
Bayraktar drones and loitering
munitions such as the Harop

6
00:00:21.123 --> 00:00:25.084
hunted air defense radars,
tanks and artillery.

7
00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:27.974
Civilians were struck on both sides,

8
00:00:28.014 --> 00:00:31.998
and Ghazanchetsots Cathedral
in Shushi was struck twice.

9
00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:35.828
In early November,
Azerbaijani special forces

10
00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:39.172
climbed through the forests
to the Shushi plateau.

11
00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:41.831
After days of fighting,
the town fell.

12
00:00:42.191 --> 00:00:44.941
On 9 November a statement
ended the fighting,

13
00:00:44.981 --> 00:00:48.054
and Shushi passed to Azerbaijan.

14
00:00:48.094 --> 00:00:49.684
The war was lost,

15
00:00:49.724 --> 00:00:54.557
but young conscripts and volunteers
had held the line for 44 days.

16
00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:59.606
Hold the heights, defender,
for as long as they can be held.

